AHEADDB uses the independently distributed open-source DuckDB, pandas, NumPy,
scikit-learn, Pydantic, FastAPI, Uvicorn, Typer and optional MCP Python SDK.
Their licenses remain applicable to their distributions. See docs/licenses.md.

The optional FastDFS comparison uses FastDFS 0.2.1 and its Featuretools/Woodwork
components. No upstream code or model weights are vendored in this repository.
Related research is attributed in docs/research.md and
 docs/THIRD_PARTY_RESEARCH.md; citations do not imply code adoption.

Public evaluation data: Online Retail (Chen,D.,2015) and Beijing Multi-Site
Air Quality (Chen,S.,2017), UCI Machine Learning Repository, CC BY 4.0.
Source datasets are downloaded separately; derived evaluation records are
attributed in docs/data.md and carry CC BY 4.0 under artifacts/results/NOTICE.
The generated SignalDesk dataset is original synthetic demonstration data.
